        "filename": "Kevin 24-7 Self-Loop SOP.md",
        "content": "# Kevin 24/7 Self-Loop\n\nIdle-without-reason is a defect. When one family is blocked, select another independent GREEN objective. Never solve a blocked invoke by declaring Yellow work Green.\n\n## Operating rule\nStay on the cadence board. Primary owner outcome remains west-motor-parts-chase-board-pack on owner-west-motor-parts-chase-fresh-8-v1. Parallel GREEN work is allowed and required while that gate is blocked.\n\n## Required sequence\n1. Sense live Support, Engineering, continuation.\n2. Reflect: classify blocked vs idle vs working honestly.\n3. Select the highest-value eligible GREEN work.\n4. If the selected work needs a missing capability, research/build/test/codify it.\n5. Verify with independent evidence.\n6. Learn: write a lesson or failure-family entry.\n7. Resume the interrupted owner objective.\n\n## Protective behavior\nDo not recopy Supervisor v1.8.12. Do not install Maintenance v1.3.54 or queue v1.3.55 before slot expiry. Do not re-enable Night Forge. Do not widen exact-five. Do not reset history. Do not send the 8-vehicle job to tool-less fixed:main.\n"
